%% Shebar Janala / Nagorik Sathi - end-to-end sequence with every actor
%% Timings, thresholds and outcomes are the values the code enforces.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor CIT as Citizen
  participant GW as USSD gateway
  participant APP as App and guards
  participant AUTH as Auth and identity
  participant CORE as Deterministic core
  participant LLM as DeepSeek
  participant DB as Turso
  participant LED as Hash chains
  actor STAFF as Staff and officers

  rect rgb(234, 244, 238)
  Note over CIT,AUTH: Registration and identity
  CIT->>APP: phone number
  APP->>AUTH: request one-time code
  AUTH->>DB: OTP hash, 5 min, 5 tries
  Note over AUTH: SMS provider, or demo outbox
  CIT->>APP: code and new PIN
  APP->>AUTH: verify, hash PIN with scrypt
  AUTH->>DB: user, profile, settings, session
  AUTH-->>CIT: access 15 min, refresh 30 days
  CIT->>APP: national ID and location
  APP->>AUTH: digit check, then geofence
  AUTH->>DB: simulated_verified, union
  end

  rect rgb(240, 240, 248)
  Note over CIT,LLM: One question, one decision
  CIT->>APP: question in Bangla
  APP->>CORE: intent, life event, entities
  CORE->>DB: BM25 over 158 chunks
  CORE->>CORE: rules over profile snapshot
  CORE->>DB: evaluation and rule version
  CORE->>LLM: fixed plan, 7 profile fields
  LLM-->>CORE: prose for that plan
  Note over CORE,LLM: no key or failure: composer answers, marked degraded
  CORE->>DB: message, ai_logs, grounding flag
  APP-->>CIT: verdict, trace, citations, confidence 65
  CIT->>APP: save it, make an action plan
  APP->>DB: saved status, tasks, timeline
  end

  rect rgb(249, 237, 237)
  Note over CIT,STAFF: Money, flags, escalation
  STAFF->>APP: post a union allocation
  APP->>DB: allocation row
  APP->>LED: append to the money chain
  CIT->>APP: flag the allocation
  APP->>DB: flag row, recount for the union
  alt 2 or more flags and ratio at least 0.5
    APP->>DB: escalation, state pending
    APP->>STAFF: notify the upazila officer
    STAFF->>APP: acknowledge, resolve or dismiss
    APP->>DB: status history
  else below the threshold
    APP-->>CIT: flag kept, no escalation
  end
  Note over APP,DB: no timeout, and the latch never re-notifies
  end

  rect rgb(240, 240, 248)
  Note over GW,STAFF: Phone-only channel, then oversight
  CIT->>GW: dial the USSD code
  GW->>APP: callback, shared secret
  APP->>DB: menu session, status or issue
  APP-->>GW: plain-text CON or END
  GW-->>CIT: menu on the handset
  STAFF->>APP: open oversight
  APP->>CORE: run 5 detectors
  CORE->>DB: allocations, benefits, escalations
  APP-->>STAFF: outliers, duplicates, overpayments
  STAFF->>LED: run the verifier
  LED-->>STAFF: chains recomputed, breaks named
  end

  Note over CIT,STAFF: Nothing here reconciles eligibility against enrolment (D-01)
